    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This striking five-bedroom home in Cappaghglass combines the character of a traditional farmhouse with the comfort and style of a contemporary extension. Having undergone substantial renovation, the property offers spacious, light-filled accommodation throughout.\r\nOccupying a private site of approximately 1.2 acres, this home enjoys beautiful sea views while remaining conveniently located just 5km from Ballydehob, 9km from Schull and only 2km from local beauty spot Audley Cove beach.\r\nThe home is full of character with thoughtful design providing generous living spaces and carefully considered features ensure the breathtaking views are a constant feature throughout the property.\r\nAnother notable element are the balconies on both the ground and first floors. Accessed from the main living area and the first floor bedrooms respectively, these elevated outdoor spaces provide the perfect vantage point to watch the sun rise, they provide a place to pause and appreciate the beauty around you.\r\nThe c.1.2-acre site presents considerable scope for a variety of uses - gardening, growing your own produce, keeping small livestock, or simply creating a natural haven to encourage wildlife. This impressive home will appeal to many West Cork property hunters.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nRural setting with Coastal views. \r\n5 bedrooms, one of which is on the ground floor. \r\nFantastic open plan split level living room / lounge area. \r\nExtensive gardens with mature trees. \r\nStore room & garden shed. \r\nOil fired central heating. \r\n\r\nServices: \r\nSeptic tank and mains water. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAll information is provided in good faith and believed to be correct; however, it is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No representations or warranties, express or implied, are made as to the accuracy, completeness, condition, or planning status of the property.\r\nInterested parties should investigate independently as to the accuracy of all details, including measurements, boundaries, area, BER rating, and available services. In addition, all apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services should be thoroughly tested to assess their working condition.\r\nPhotographs and videos are for guidance purposes only and may show items (such as furniture) that are not included in the sale unless specifically agreed between the parties."
